  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 6502.12 Third-party provider",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 6502.12 “Third-party provider” means any entity under contract with an interlock service provider to perform one or more of the provider’s responsibilities under statute and these rules.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Saf-C 6500) #13448, eff 9-20-22",
